{"id": "CmqkHqbhIBa", "title": "Video by vassia.sar", "description": "If you are an over explainer, you learned that your feelings and needs:\n🔸 will hurt others\n🔸 are selfish\n🔸 are a punishment\n🔸 are burdensome\n🔸 are unimportant\n🔸…\n\nIt makes sense why every time you want to express yourself, you feel guilty, like you are doing something wrong. 🥺\n\nIt makes sense that you use a million words to express yourself. It helps you feel less uncomfortable about your needs and feelings. 😬\n\nIt makes sense that you over explain yourself to to avoid or “fix” other people’s feelings. You were raised believing that you are the reason others feel hurt. 😔\n\nIf you tend to over explain yourself, remember:\n👉 Your needs and feelings are valid. You have every right to express them.\n👉 To the people you love, your feelings and needs are not a burden.\n👉 All feelings are a part of healthy relationships. It is normal to feel hurt or sad as much as it is normal to feel happy.\n\n#OverExplaining #TraumaHealing #TraumaResponse #PeoplePleaserNoMore #SelfHealing #innerwork #mentalhealthawareness #selfcompassion #personalgrowth #emotionalhealth #selfdevelopment #youareworthy #mentalhealthtips #feelingsmatter #feelingsarevalid #selfloveisthebestlove #settingboundaries", "channel": "vassia.sar", "uploader_id": "8127537092", "uploader": "Vassia Sar | Psychologist", "timestamp": 1672130574, "like_count": 213078, "comment_count": 1741, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-570200261587589a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 73.057, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://scontent-mad1-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQP3f2ZA8_soE5dlZfIFLa7O44kyyl_gToUccVCCKlPcyTo-MYSKO0v1Ds_EnzB6_ewMftPtQk0aSt_3ELooacA.mp4?_nc_cat=107&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=scontent-mad1-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=3trPBDW7tgwQ7kNvwH_nbGc&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=u_Vv2GXwDkAtxUQh1E7moA&_nc_ss=70a8