711592952828_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=102&ig_cache_key=MzAwMjM3MDk1Nzg2NTQxODg0Mg%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjExMjUuc2RyLnZpZGVvX2RlZmF1bHRfY292ZXJfZnJhbWUuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=Spbr8DN1FfkQ7kNvwFuB5BU&_nc_oc=Adp22aKPJUHMsDrS8tow6l_TxLQgSbCmRa6CpCvLCRjLMNTUrq7-pSZLBxxnohSi3eo&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-mad1-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=u_Vv2GXwDkAtxUQh1E7moA&_nc_ss=70a8c&oh=00_AQOoLuLfDNR0LkdAzsds-oadd5jqE9C0a7WzRHTRVlmNLw&oe=6ACF44FE", "width": 1125, "height": 2000, "id": "12", "resolution": "1125x2000"}], "comments": [{"author": "iamscarlett.ai", "author_id": "71767000043", "id": "18155541937450886", "text": "Over-explaining is just asking for permission to take up space, dressed up as extra detail.", "timestamp": 1790241530, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "thereal_drsilence", "author_id": "25654479944", "id": "18624198697047601", "text": "Yes, it can be trauma based, but how to get rid of it? That is what count and there's some concrete steps to take.", "timestamp": 1787722046, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "shlokkumaraswamy", "author_id": "75636387478", "id": "18100400027350450", "text": "Great insight. I appreciate you sharing this.", "timestamp": 1787227552, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "simply_adorabal", "author_id": "76101138497", "id": "18188131084379758", "text": "I'm trying to stop overexplain because even after overexplain my heart don't get ease it's make me overthinking, I thought if I'm making them bore.😢 I hate this feeling 😔", "timestamp": 1781837532, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "thewellformedco", "author_id": "75149735998", "id": "18048748232707648", "text": "This totally makes sense now, thank you for explaining over explaining 🌿", "timestamp": 1772623476, "like_count": 2}, {"author": "true.self.activation", "author_id": "75677313949", "id": "18151435396452887", "text": "Over-explaining = fawn response in action. Your nervous system learned that detail = safety, that thoroughness = protection. But with safe people, you don't need a dissertation to be heard. The healing is learning who gets your silence, who gets your summary, and who gets the full story.", "timestamp": 1771488415, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "samartha.english", "author_id": "80319033593", "id": "18343995961226198", "text": "Very well explained . I can resonate. and I am working on myself on this .", "timestamp": 1770704341, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "enthusiasticaboutlife1000", "author_id": "66454299917", "id": "18085541078033570", "text": "Very good explanation , so if I'm right in thinking we have learned that our needs are bad and not right and we need to look after other people's , so effectively we have to carry 2 burdens 1. Our needs 2. The other persons . No wonder these poor people are burnt out with such burdens :(", "timestamp": 1767697967, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "ilona.benedek.3538", "author_id": "17845561747", "id": "18327826537243501", "text": "I recognize this pattern in myself.Thanks❤️👏🔥🙌❤️👏🔥🙌", "timestamp": 1765683815, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "sothatswhy.me", "author_id": "77959600999", "id": "18111451294610198", "text": "this validates something i've been feeling but couldn't name.", "timestamp": 1764271218, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "hello.lilawills", "author_id": "73118689158", "id": "18081288314006961", "text": "❤️❤️", "timestamp": 1760576957, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "nikhilmukhija", "author_id": "3243029438", "id": "17990603449899515", "text": "@stubbrn_rhiz", "timestamp": 1688105309, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "jannataueki", "author_id": "259721312", "id": "17984155441959560", "text": "@hollieornsby", "timestamp": 1680236399, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "jannataueki", "author_id": "259721312", "id": "17969770859330690", "text": "@hollieornsby", "timestamp": 1679897827, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "silver_linings_counseling", "author_id": "18562682108", "id": "17848572935938517", "text": "love this", "timestamp": 1679858029, "like_count": 0